    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>As an Empty, you push your body farther than most. You gain either 1 additional @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.feats.xlxtzvhGLTVVcBrp]{Empty Resilience - Resolve Point}, or gain an additional attribute bonus. This attribute bonus is in addition to and separate from the set of @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.feats.mVq6drJYxlXmIPQ0]{Empty Resilience - Attribute Bonus} you gain from your revels. Regardless of your choice, you also gain a skill increase to a skill you have. You must meet the level requirements to increase a skill to a new proficiency tier.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You can take this feat again at 7th, 11th, and 15th level.</p>"
